<title>POLAND: BRE JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 8.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>BRE JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 8.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  8.49 vs   11.08</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   13.20 vs   19.56</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 29.53 vs   27.04</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	50.83 vs   39.22</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Rozwoju Exportu SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
